Test corpus
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

`make corpus-fetch` downloads SQL from public repositories into
corpus/cache/. Those files are NOT distributed with this project: every
source is pinned to an exact commit in src/dbsqlparse/corpus/sources.py and
fetched on demand, and the cache is not committed.

The sources are third-party works under their own licences, used here only
as parser input for measurement. They retain their original copyright. See
`sources.py` for the repository and revision of each.

Among them:

  Apache Spark
  Copyright 2014 and onwards The Apache Software Foundation
  https://github.com/apache/spark
  Apache-2.0. Supplies the SQL test suites and the TPC-DS/TPC-H/SSB queries.

  SQLFluff
  Copyright (c) 2023 SQLFluff authors
  https://github.com/sqlfluff/sqlfluff
  MIT. Supplies the databricks and sparksql dialect fixtures.

