--------------------------------------------------------------------------
History
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project previously shipped a parser generated by ANTLR from Apache
Spark's SqlBase grammar. That parser was retired once SQLFluff proved the
better parser for Databricks SQL; the grammar, the generated sources and the
ANTLR dependency have all been removed. See docs/design-notes.md.
